<!--
  The status-bar icon for every notification (downloads, reminders).

  Android draws a notification's small icon from its alpha channel only, so a
  full-colour picture shows as a plain white square. This is the launcher's
  open book as one white silhouette (the same shape as the Android 13 themed
  icon, scaled from its 108dp canvas to 24dp); setColor(brand_green) on the
  notification tints it green in the shade. Redrawn 10 Oct with the icon.
-->
